# Architecture

- Layers: `app` routes → feature components → hooks/utils/constants
- Shared chrome: Header, Footer
- Static pages only; CloudFront signed-cookie access via `proxy/` for test CDN
- Keep product surface small (Home / About) — no Cognito/SWR/admin without product approval
- See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
